{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dive into a fresh take on spatial puzzles\u2014<strong>Quadcubes</strong> challenges you to think in three dimensions. Every move matters as you manipulate falling shapes around the X, Y and Z axes to complete and clear layers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play at your own pace in <strong>Relax Mode</strong>, or test your reflexes in <strong>Challenge Mode</strong>, where cleared layers speed up the descent of new pieces. <br>Choose a 4\u00d74, 5\u00d75 or 6\u00d76 playfield and tailor the difficulty to your skill level.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Key Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>True 3D Rotation</strong> \u2013 Full freedom to spin and slide each block in all three axes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Two Game Modes</strong> \u2013 Relax Mode for stress\u2011free play; Challenge Mode for escalating speed.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Variable Playfields</strong> \u2013 Select 4\u00d74, 5\u00d75 or 6\u00d76 grids to scale complexity.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Minimalist Design</strong> \u2013 Clean visuals keep the focus on puzzle\u2011solving.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Progress Tracking</strong> \u2013 Leaderboard support and personal bests to chase higher scores.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3898080?t=1753517877","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3898080?t=1753517877","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3898080/aa0341093b4a5e7362fff22cc37e735db43c71c5/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1753517877","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3898080/aa0341093b4a5e7362fff22cc37e735db43c71c5/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1753517877","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dive into a fresh take on spatial puzzles\u2014<strong>Quadcubes</strong> challenges you to think in three dimensions. Every move matters as you manipulate falling shapes around the X, Y and Z axes to complete and clear layers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play at your own pace in <strong>Relax Mode</strong>, or test your reflexes in <strong>Challenge Mode</strong>, where cleared layers speed up the descent of new pieces. <br>Choose a 4\u00d74, 5\u00d75 or 6\u00d76 playfield and tailor the difficulty to your skill level.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Key Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>True 3D Rotation</strong> \u2013 Full freedom to spin and slide each block in all three axes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Two Game Modes</strong> \u2013 Relax Mode for stress\u2011free play; Challenge Mode for escalating speed.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Variable Playfields</strong> \u2013 Select 4\u00d74, 5\u00d75 or 6\u00d76 grids to scale complexity.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Minimalist Design</strong> \u2013 Clean visuals keep the focus on puzzle\u2011solving.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Progress Tracking</strong> \u2013 Leaderboard support and personal bests to chase higher scores.</p></li></ul>","developers":["dewle"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3898080/883bfe575d6393dc6356810ec032e44f16031747/header.jpg?t=1753517877","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"name":"Quadcubes",